    "md": "if statement\n\n```js\nif(condition) {\n```\n\nexe code\n\n```js\n}\n```\n\nif else if else\n\n```js\nif(true){\n}\nelse if(true){\n}\nelse {\n}\n```\n\nternary operator\n\n```js\n(true) ? console.log(\"yes\") : console.log(\"no\"); // yes\n(false) ? console.log(\"yes\") : console.log(\"no\"); // no\n(false) ? console.log(\"y\") : (true) ? console.log(\"yes\"): console.log(\"n\"); // yes\n```\n\nswitch case\n\n```js\nlet i = 1\nswitch (i) {\n```\n\ncase 0:\n\n```js\n        console.log(0);\n        break;\n```\n\ncase 1:\n\n```js\n        console.log(`1`);\n```\n\ndefault:\n\n```js\n        break;\n}\n```\n",
